{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Waky Alarm 是一款以任務鬧鐘為核心的起床工具，專為經常關掉鬧鐘後再度入睡、早上提不起勁的人而設。它要求你完成指定任務才可關閉響聲，並以每日語錄與自訂鬧鐘畫面為每個早晨增添動力。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>任務鬧鐘強制喚醒</h2>\n<p>設定鬧鐘後，必須完成解題或指定動作才能關掉響聲，迫使大腦真正清醒，不再為賴床而自責。每日語錄會隨鬧鐘送上，為早晨注入動力與勇氣。你亦可自訂鬧鐘畫面，加入個人寄語或挑選合心意的主題。內置專注計時器在離開程式後仍持續運作，時間到便自動提醒，適合讀書或工作時使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-643-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-644-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-645-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-646-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-647-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-648-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Waky Alarm – Start proud today</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T23:58:10.484918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}